1) CLASSICAL LOAD BALANCER:-
     claassical load baalncer is an old type of aws elastic load balancer that distribute incoming application traffic acrorss multiple ec2 instance
     distribute traffic to multiple server
     send traffic only to healthy instance
     support http, https, tcp, & ssl


   FEATURES                    DESCRIPTION
1)layer support                layer 4 & 7
2)protocol                     http, https, tcp, ssl
3)health check                 yes
4)ssl offloading               yes
5)session stickness            yes



ADAVANATAGES OF LBA:-
1) simple to use
2) support stickly session


DISDVANTAGES OF LBA:-
1) older technology 
2) limited routing features
3) less efficient than alb & nlb


